WEBVTT

00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:06.053
Staff see it under Commerce, Transactions.

00:00:06.053 --> 00:00:08.320
The order made two transactions:

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.854
the twenty percent deposit, to be paid by bank transfer, and the rest,

00:00:12.854 --> 00:00:18.521
from the source company-terms, put on Northwind Traders's account with its purchase order

00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:20.489
number, due in thirty days.

00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:22.824
Open the one on account.

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:27.716
Its timeline says it was put on Northwind's account, due in thirty days.

00:00:27.716 --> 00:00:33.612
When the company pays, enter the amount and a reference under Record an offline payment.

00:00:34.063 --> 00:00:37.781
Click Record payment, and confirm that it counts as received.

00:00:37.781 --> 00:00:42.164
The transaction shows what is paid, and what is still outstanding, so you

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:44.383
always know what the company owes.

